# Mandate Holder — Home Tab Overhaul: Team & Task Management Hub

## Background

Currently, the Mandate Holder's **Home** tab renders `UserHomeView` — a personal task list that doesn't fit the management role.

Per the user's request, the **Home** tab will be **replaced entirely** with a full-featured **Team & Task Management Hub**, giving the Mandate Holder CRUD over team members and all task types, with distinct visual treatment per task type.

---

## Design Decisions (Confirmed)

| Question | Answer |
|---|---|
| Home tab becomes | Full team+task management panel (no personal task list) |
| Designation bulk-assign | ALL users holding that designation get the task |
| Delegation 3-deadline auto-replace | Brand-new delegation record created; old one closed |
| Deadline #2 / #3 setter | **Only Mandate Holder / Owner** can extend deadlines |
| Compliance = | `is_important=true` checklist item + new `is_compliance=1` flag for sticky UI treatment |

---

## Task Color Palette (per PRD §14.1 — navy + hotpink + whites only)

| Task Type | Color Token | Visual |
|---|---|---|
| **Repetitive / Checklist** | `--navy-100` border + `--navy-900` tag | Neutral, standard card |
| **Flow-based (FMS)** | `--amber-100` border + `--amber-700` tag | Warm amber/gold badge |
| **Delegation** | `--pink-brand` border + `--pink-brand` tag | Hot pink accent — pinned top |
| **Compliance** | `--red-100` border + `--red-700` tag | Light-pink/red sticky badge |

> **Note:** "Red" per PRD §14.1 = light pink shade, not a separate red color. Amber is used for FMS to stay within the earth-tone palette.

