## Open Questions / Warnings

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The `delegations` table currently has no concept of `deadline_no`, `deadline_date`, or auto-replace logic. A **schema migration is required** (additive columns only — no existing data is destroyed).

> [!WARNING]
> The existing `delegations` table uses `tat_hours` as the single deadline. The new Delegation Task system adds optional initial deadline (`deadline_at`), deadline attempt counter (`deadline_no`), and auto-replace trigger. Existing delegation rows will have `deadline_no = 0` and be treated as legacy.

> [!NOTE]
> The Mandate Holder will no longer see their own task list on Home. If the Mandate Holder wants to see their own tasks, they do so via the **Score** or **Systems** tab (as per PRD §13.2 structure). This matches the user's explicit request.

