#### [MODIFY] [`db/index.ts`](file:///c:/Users/admin/Desktop/Website/KATL-operations/src/server/db/index.ts)

Add the following to `initDatabase()` via **`ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS`** guards (SQLite-safe approach via try/catch per-column):

