#### Section B — Designation-Based Bulk Task Assignment

| Method | Route | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/mandate/designation-tasks` | List all designation task templates |
| `POST` | `/api/mandate/designation-tasks` | Create template + auto-expand to all users in that designation |
| `PATCH` | `/api/mandate/designation-tasks/:id` | Edit template (title, frequency, priority) |
| `DELETE` | `/api/mandate/designation-tasks/:id` | Deactivate template + stop future occurrences |

**`POST /api/mandate/designation-tasks` logic:**
1. Validate body: `{ title_en, title_hi, priority, task_type, frequency, designation_id, is_important, is_compliance, due_time }`
2. Insert row into `designation_task_templates`
3. Fetch all users with `designation_id` via `user_designations`
4. For each user → call `WorkItemService.createWorkItem()` + insert `checklist_definitions` row with `target_type='USER'` and `target_id = user.id`
5. Return `{ success: true, assigned_to_count: N }`

